# Build context for deploy/compose/Dockerfile.server, whose context is the repo root.
#
# The CA private key is the reason this file exists: it lives under .local/tls and has no
# business being sent to a Docker daemon, even though it never reaches the image.
.git
.github
.local
bin
gen/**/*_test.go
docs
deploy
client
agents
BACKLOG.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md
**/__pycache__
*.pem
*.key
